     3504     HIDE FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     3505   END PROCEDURE.
     3506   PROCEDURE enable_UI :
     3507     DISPLAY sch-corr-date sch-pl-code sch-corr-user-name mark-num
     3508         WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
